WEBVTT

00:02:29.785 --> 00:02:33.803
deb ham yuritilgan, chunki 
u bilan, asosan, immuniteti zaif

00:02:33.803 --> 00:02:36.393
kambag'al rassom va shoirlar kasallangan.

00:02:36.393 --> 00:02:42.771
Silning tashqi belgilari hatto vampirlar 
haqidagi afsonalarning ommalashishiga

00:02:42.771 --> 00:02:47.651
turtki bo'lgan. Kasallikka nisbatan bunday
ilmiy asoslanmagan yondashuvlar sabab

00:02:47.651 --> 00:02:52.682
mazkur davrda silni davolash uchun 
dastlabki qadam qo'yildi.

00:02:52.682 --> 00:02:56.373
1882-yil nemis shifokori Robert Kox

00:02:56.373 --> 00:02:59.451
kasallikning bakterial 
xususiyatini aniqladi.

00:02:59.451 --> 00:03:04.361
13 yildan so'ng Vilgelm Rentgen rentgen
nurlarini aniqlagach, shifokorlarda